    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/563094d12b11e64f75e9551107a5d9a9.poster.avif?t=1752798329\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/563094d12b11e64f75e9551107a5d9a9.webm?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/563094d12b11e64f75e9551107a5d9a9.mp4?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/9ee8a002038fb47b68c47a6168182349.avif?t=1752798329\" width=512 height=76 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a castle on wheels that will eat everything in front of it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded your vehicle-fortress with weapon modules like cannons, a wizard tower, explosive mines and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Action-rich gameplay with vehicle maneuvers, ability-timing and satisfying driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your modules in a Survivors-like progression system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight diverse enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your castle bigger and bigger by defeating bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock New modules and vehicles  between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different builds in every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new biomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e89d2d8b979a8d14e35dae4256e97150.poster.avif?t=1752798329\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e89d2d8b979a8d14e35dae4256e97150.webm?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e89d2d8b979a8d14e35dae4256e97150.mp4?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/0bbf80000ec7eab88a0b0dca1c00c217.avif?t=1752798329\" width=512 height=76 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an ecosystem of castles on wheels, a medieval shark-tank of predatory fortresses hunting peaceful villages - there\u2019s always a bigger fish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anachronistic Technology like Knights on Bikes, Steam-Powered Siege-Engines and Castles firing broadsides like a Pirate-Ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastical, huge vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Destruction effects from the makers of ABRISS - build to destroy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/38c886174ffbd6f16a9e5ae4c8b5a78b.poster.avif?t=1752798329\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/38c886174ffbd6f16a9e5ae4c8b5a78b.webm?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/38c886174ffbd6f16a9e5ae4c8b5a78b.mp4?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e26fc58ea12a3dadbc4fb82bb2545f82.avif?t=1752798329\" width=512 height=76 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-Input: Playable with mouse, touchscreen, keyboard, or controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handheld-readable artstyle: Good on small and big screens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready-For-Potato: Highly optimized for even Office PCs</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/563094d12b11e64f75e9551107a5d9a9.poster.avif?t=1752798329\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/563094d12b11e64f75e9551107a5d9a9.webm?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/563094d12b11e64f75e9551107a5d9a9.mp4?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/9ee8a002038fb47b68c47a6168182349.avif?t=1752798329\" width=512 height=76 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a castle on wheels that will eat everything in front of it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded your vehicle-fortress with weapon modules like cannons, a wizard tower, explosive mines and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Action-rich gameplay with vehicle maneuvers, ability-timing and satisfying driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your modules in a Survivors-like progression system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight diverse enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your castle bigger and bigger by defeating bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock New modules and vehicles  between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different builds in every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new biomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e89d2d8b979a8d14e35dae4256e97150.poster.avif?t=1752798329\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e89d2d8b979a8d14e35dae4256e97150.webm?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e89d2d8b979a8d14e35dae4256e97150.mp4?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/0bbf80000ec7eab88a0b0dca1c00c217.avif?t=1752798329\" width=512 height=76 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an ecosystem of castles on wheels, a medieval shark-tank of predatory fortresses hunting peaceful villages - there\u2019s always a bigger fish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anachronistic Technology like Knights on Bikes, Steam-Powered Siege-Engines and Castles firing broadsides like a Pirate-Ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastical, huge vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Destruction effects from the makers of ABRISS - build to destroy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/38c886174ffbd6f16a9e5ae4c8b5a78b.poster.avif?t=1752798329\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/38c886174ffbd6f16a9e5ae4c8b5a78b.webm?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/38c886174ffbd6f16a9e5ae4c8b5a78b.mp4?t=1752798329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e26fc58ea12a3dadbc4fb82bb2545f82.avif?t=1752798329\" width=512 height=76 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-Input: Playable with mouse, touchscreen, keyboard, or controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handheld-readable artstyle: Good on small and big screens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready-For-Potato: Highly optimized for even Office PCs</p></li></ul>",
